plan "Two-bedroom flat"
walls outside 0.3 inside 0.1 height 2.6
windows sill 0.9 height 1.3

room living  "Living room" living   4.4 x 4.2  at 0.15,0.15
room kitchen "Kitchen"     kitchen  4.4 x 3.0  north of living
room bed1    "Bedroom 1"   bedroom  4.4 x 3.1  east of living
room hall    "Hall"        corridor 1.3 x *    north of bed1 until kitchen
room bath    "Bathroom"    bathroom *   x 1.6  east of hall until bed1
room bed2    "Bedroom 2"   bedroom  3.0 x *    north of bath until hall

door door-entrance in hall north, 0.2 from west, 0.9 wide, opens in, hinged east
door door-living  between hall and living, 0.1 from south, 0.8 wide, opens into living, hinged south
door door-kitchen between hall and kitchen, 0.55 from south of kitchen, 0.8 wide, opens into kitchen, hinged south
door door-bed1    between hall and bed1, 0.25 from west, 0.8 wide, opens into bed1, hinged west
door door-bath    between hall and bath, 0.45 from south, 0.7 wide, opens into bath, hinged south
door door-bed2    between hall and bed2, 0.25 from south of bed2, 0.8 wide, opens into bed2, hinged south
opening pass-kitchen-living between kitchen and living, 1.35 from west, 1.2 wide
window win-living-south in living south, 1.05 from west, 1.8 wide, sill 0.6, height 1.5
window win-living-west  in living west, 1.35 from south, 1.4 wide
window win-kitchen      in kitchen west, 0.95 from south, 1.2 wide, sill 1.0, height 1.1
window win-bed1         in bed1 south, 1.55 from west, 1.4 wide
window win-bath         in bath east, 0.45 from south, 0.6 wide, sill 1.4, height 0.7
window win-bed2         in bed2 east, 0.65 from south, 1.2 wide
